Source: libapache2-mod-maat
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Maât contributors <maat-developers@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), apache2-dev, libapr1-dev, libaprutil1-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Damdoshi/openssh-portable

Package: libapache2-mod-maat
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, apache2-api-20120211
Description: experimental Maât broker-integrated request identity for Apache 2.4
 An Apache module that strips spoofable Maât request headers and
 verifies single-use SSH tickets directly with the broker on a private listener.
 Exposes only per-request broker-verified context to php-maat.
 Does not activate itself and is not ready for production.
